ndividual's nutritional health, providing insights into their body composition.", "HEMIGLOSECTOMY:Hemiglosectomy is a surgical procedure performed on the patient to remove part of the tongue.", "NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENT:Nutritional supplements are specialized products, such as Ensure Plus Advance and Fresubin, designed to provide essential nutrients for individuals with specific dietary needs. These supplements are particularly beneficial for patients requiring enhanced caloric and protein intake, including those managing diabetes. They serve to support overall health and nutritional requirements in various medical and dietary contexts.", "RADIOTHERAPY:Radiotherapy is a treatment method that employs high doses of radiation to effectively kill cancer cells and reduce the size of tumors. This therapeutic approach is often accompanied by side effects, one of which can include diarrhea. In a specific case, a patient underwent radiotherapy consisting of five sessions to address a medical condition, highlighting its application in clinical settings.", "INSULIN GLARGINE:Insulin glargine is a long-acting insulin used in the management of diabetes, adjusted for the patient's treatment.", "MAXILOFACIAL CONSULTATION:Maxillofacial consultation refers to the medical evaluation the patient underwent related to their oral and facial health.", "SUPPLEMENT ORAL:Oral supplements are nutritional products taken by the patient to support dietary needs, specifically for diabetes management.", "SERVICIO DE NEFROLOGÍA:El servicio de nefrología está involucrado en el seguimiento y tratamiento de la función renal del paciente, que ha mejorado levemente tras la adecuada hidratación y cambios nutricionales.", "DESNUTRICIÓN CALÓRICO-PROTEICA MODERADA:La desnutrición calórico-proteica moderada es una condición diagnosticada en el paciente, que afecta su salud y requiere intervención nutricional.", "IRC ESTADIO 4:La insuficiencia renal crónica (IRC) en estadio 4 es una condición médica diagnosticada en el paciente, que indica un deterioro significativo de la función renal.", "NE ESPECÍFICA PARA DIABETES:La nutrición enteral específica para diabetes es un tipo de soporte nutricional diseñado para mejorar el control glucémico en pacientes diabéticos."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}